  "description": "Because of a contract mix-up, Elara Bloom, a design student, and Seraphine Moore, an office worker, end up sharing an apartment under a co-rental arrangement. What starts out awkward and distant slowly becomes comfortable through their everyday life together. Elara begins to see Seraphine as a source of inspiration, while Seraphine discovers a warmth she didn’t even realize she was missing. From a simple coincidence, feelings grow—without either of them planning it.\n\n_Source: WEBTOON Canvas_",
